</node>
<node id="Line of Effect">
  <data key="d0">Line of Effect</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Line of Effect (LOE) is a military concept that connects a series of combat objectives in chronological and logical sequence, representing temporal and causal relationships.</data>
