<node id="Battlefield Situation">
  <data key="d0">Battlefield Situation</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Battlefield Situation refers to the current and expected battlefield conditions that serve as nodes in the action line.&lt;SEP&gt;Battlefield situation refers to the specific tactical conditions and developments within the operational area that affect combat decisions.&lt;SEP&gt;Battlefield situation refers to the current conditions and developments in the battlefield.&lt;SEP&gt;Battlefield situation refers to the real-time operational environment and conditions during combat.&lt;SEP&gt;Battlefield situation refers to the overall conditions and developments on the battlefield.&lt;SEP&gt;Battlefield situation refers to the battlefield conditions based on which enemy possible operational plans are inferred.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c43df6ccd3d1cffa3dea06dde0dcef0a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-89c2553983e206a8e297fe9cdac66169&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4e076ff2b14def31d05c594776649eee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c868520f6a3dc6f1e022369db6d23482&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bc4c1f92f953300c7b9ad35242864ff7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-79ee866bec5531e5d971890f7a2559fa</data>
