  <data key="d2">Combat Area refers to the geographic region where combat operations take place, directly related to action lines.&lt;SEP&gt;Combat area refers to the geographic region where combat operations are conducted.&lt;SEP&gt;Combat Area is the geographic region where combat operations are conducted.</data>
