<node id="Operational Plan">
  <data key="d0">Operational Plan</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The Operational Plan is the output of mission planning, including overall plans, branch plans, and coordination instructions for troops.&lt;SEP&gt;Operational Plan is the final output of the planning process, detailing actions, resources, and coordination.&lt;SEP&gt;The Operational Plan includes overall schemes, branch plans, support plans, and operational orders drafted during the planning process.&lt;SEP&gt;Operational Plan solves who, when, where, and how actions are taken and implemented.&lt;SEP&gt;Operational plan refers to the pre-planned course of action for military operations, which is revised based on battlefield changes and defined combat tasks.&lt;SEP&gt;Operational plan is the document that derives necessary support from operational task planning.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-89c2553983e206a8e297fe9cdac66169&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-112dc88d3b89a6b06ab8767eb54ad739&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fa9aa65c773b4ac4c1207cd5361f531e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7ad0e7eab09ee2232d2cf67519d5dbb8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-635858509e41f8078abbb43649372ec8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d03367b3f7f20f2a9f77e53026ed67d7</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
