  <data key="d2">Combat Objectives refer to the specific goals to be accomplished through military actions.&lt;SEP&gt;Combat objectives are the specific goals to be achieved through combat operations.&lt;SEP&gt;Combat Objectives are the goals that military operations aim to achieve.</data>
