  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Enemy Center of Gravity is a focal point around which target selection is often organized to impact the enemy's operational system.&lt;SEP&gt;Enemy center of gravity analysis is used in enemy action inference to identify critical enemy vulnerabilities.</data>
