  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Campaign progress refers to the stages and sequence of campaign execution, used in designing campaign process and strike target nomination.&lt;SEP&gt;Campaign progress refers to the advancement and development of military campaigns over time.</data>
