<node id="Commander">
  <data key="d0">Commander</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Commander is a military leader who holds primary responsibility for operational planning, strategic intent comprehension, and decision‑making across the full spectrum of combat activities. In this role, the Commander formulates initial campaign concepts, designs campaigns, conducts wargaming evaluations, and supervises the development of task plans. The Commander issues orders for troop movements and combat operations, approves final combat plans, and provides guidance throughout the plan development process, including reviews and revisions.

Beyond planning, the Commander organizes combat assessments, analyzes target‑strike effects, evaluates the achievement of strategic goals, tracks campaign progress, and determines the overall direction of operations. The Commander utilizes situational‑awareness information systems to share relevant data, enabling coordinated planning and maintaining a common operational picture. In the United States Navy context, the Commander makes scientific decisions and generates combat determinations during the mission‑planning process, ensuring that plans are technically sound and aligned with strategic objectives.

The Commander also relies on intelligence support for planning, decision‑making, and ongoing command activities, receiving enemy action‑plan evaluation results and recommendations to inform choices. Throughout all these functions, the Commander acts as the central decision‑maker and leader of joint operational planning, integrating situational awareness, intelligence, and strategic guidance to direct forces effectively.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-43ccfe322d45a2193b169b151539c560&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-444624ac7ec860ede259c10c50f0513a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-38d3c5592e48544d872c05c7c8f83f77&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fa9aa65c773b4ac4c1207cd5361f531e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-86b265ec00b234e282f6fbd72461d3a7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7ad0e7eab09ee2232d2cf67519d5dbb8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-67849e0b5328f68ea35509bd6b19645b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b3a38c5d2bd5aded4f705e8a27f80c90&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4e076ff2b14def31d05c594776649eee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4f1759230375668c37a3de633d934a17&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-659db68304082ade8ac85e6762c422cb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-635858509e41f8078abbb43649372ec8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d03367b3f7f20f2a9f77e53026ed67d7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7b0ab60a625810ad5c7b928b03f9f35b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-79ee866bec5531e5d971890f7a2559fa</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1778766699</data>
