  <data key="d2">Pre-combat planning refers to the planning conducted during crisis or imminent war situations, with limited time available for plan development.&lt;SEP&gt;Pre-combat planning is conducted in the combat preparation phase based on assigned missions and real-time battlefield situations.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-bafe3365a36fae45b1bf2e0446eac189&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8bcc2f01cacb5d64a03f00ef0877625a</data>
