<node id="Air Suppression Formation">
  <data key="d0">Air Suppression Formation</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Air suppression formation is responsible for destroying and suppressing enemy air defense systems to ensure breakthrough formations can successfully penetrate defenses.</data>
