<node id="Suppression Targets">
  <data key="d0">Suppression Targets</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Suppression targets include enemy radars, surface-to-air missile positions, anti-aircraft artillery positions, and fighter aircraft airports that threaten the strike force.</data>
