<node id="Naval Combat Operations">
  <data key="d0">Naval Combat Operations</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">Naval combat operations encompass actions across oceans, seas, bays, islands, coastal areas, and adjacent air and electromagnetic spaces, including underwater, surface, and aerial domains.</data>
