  <data key="d0">Naval Strike Group</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Naval strike group refers to carrier strike groups or mobile naval formations consisting of large surface ships, attack nuclear submarines, and carrier-based aviation.</data>
