<node id="Joint Operations">
  <data key="d0">Joint Operations</data>
  <data key="d1">event</data>
  <data key="d2">Joint Operations is the context for operational planning, involving commanders and command organizations coordinating multiple forces.&lt;SEP&gt;Joint operations refer to coordinated military actions involving multiple forces including naval, ground, and air components.&lt;SEP&gt;Joint Operations involve coordinated actions across multiple military domains to achieve unified operational objectives.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-52002d5c447b3c7fdbb3908a46c355ae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-003a5d2c8802dfadf15c1edad5131699&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fa9aa65c773b4ac4c1207cd5361f531e</data>
