  <data key="d0">Enemy Sub-Actions</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Enemy Sub-Actions are detailed tactical actions derived from dividing enemy combat plans, including intelligence analysis products, feasibility assessments, and risk evaluations.</data>
