<node id="Combat Scenario">
  <data key="d0">Combat Scenario</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Combat scenario refers to the hypothetical situation used for plan simulation and testing.&lt;SEP&gt;Combat Scenario is a hypothetical combat situation used for planning and rehearsal purposes.&lt;SEP&gt;Combat Scenario is a hypothetical situation describing the enemy's most likely combat plan and the most threatening combat plan based on current enemy force status.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-444624ac7ec860ede259c10c50f0513a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-38d3c5592e48544d872c05c7c8f83f77&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8f5b0f0bcf4f17a0423f4bb55586b580</data>
