  <data key="d0">Combat Action</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Combat Action refers to military operations and activities conducted by combat forces.&lt;SEP&gt;Combat Action refers to military activities including deployment, maneuver, coordination, and engagement conducted by forces during operations.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-444624ac7ec860ede259c10c50f0513a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-67849e0b5328f68ea35509bd6b19645b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-39e101ad5b001673244e87b269cca1df</data>
