<node id="Intelligence">
  <data key="d0">Intelligence</data>
  <data key="d1">data</data>
  <data key="d2">Intelligence is the core concept discussed in the text, serving as the foundation for combat policy development and providing decision advantages in warfare.&lt;SEP&gt;Intelligence refers to information collected through reconnaissance used to update, verify, and determine target status, including target association relationship lists.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-444624ac7ec860ede259c10c50f0513a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4e076ff2b14def31d05c594776649eee</data>
