  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Decision Point refers to critical points in operations where key decisions must be made.&lt;SEP&gt;Decision point is a critical point identified during plan deduction and simulation to find risks and decision moments in the combat plan.&lt;SEP&gt;Decision Point refers to the critical moments and locations where commanders must make key decisions during operation implementation, including sufficient conditions, necessary conditions, and decision basis.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-444624ac7ec860ede259c10c50f0513a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-86b265ec00b234e282f6fbd72461d3a7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-67849e0b5328f68ea35509bd6b19645b</data>
