<node id="Joint Campaign Commander">
  <data key="d0">Joint Campaign Commander</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Joint campaign commander is the military leader responsible for leading the understanding of intentions, situation assessment, and task analysis.&lt;SEP&gt;Joint Campaign Commander refers to the military commander responsible for leading joint campaign operations and directing the planning team.&lt;SEP&gt;Joint campaign commander is responsible for making combat decisions, typically organizing this process through meetings.&lt;SEP&gt;Joint Campaign Commander is the military leader who provides commands and instructions for network attack and defense planning in joint fire strike operations.&lt;SEP&gt;Joint Campaign Commander is a military commander responsible for planning, decision-making, and command of joint operations, requiring intelligence support.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-b76b9404888b1ba7ea6890ea44e06497&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-30f82772b0d833e6eb3891686c80b3f7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4e076ff2b14def31d05c594776649eee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8f5b0f0bcf4f17a0423f4bb55586b580&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-92553208105fab6dba3a8603376ed607</data>
