<node id="Combat Mission Analysis">
  <data key="d0">Combat Mission Analysis</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Combat mission analysis involves analyzing tasks (basic, assigned, and implied), selecting targets, analyzing combat focus, calculating force requirements and combat resources, clarifying combat policies and constraints, and estimating possible effects, risks, and costs of military operations.&lt;SEP&gt;Combat Mission Analysis is one of three fundamental tasks in operational planning, involving detailed analysis of combat missions and their purposes.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-b76b9404888b1ba7ea6890ea44e06497&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-86b265ec00b234e282f6fbd72461d3a7</data>
