  <data key="d0">Strategic Goals</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Strategic Goals represent the overall objectives and purposes that military operations aim to achieve.&lt;SEP&gt;Strategic goals are the long-term objectives that military operations aim to achieve.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-b76b9404888b1ba7ea6890ea44e06497&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7ad0e7eab09ee2232d2cf67519d5dbb8</data>
