<node id="Intelligence Preparation">
  <data key="d0">Intelligence Preparation</data>
  <data key="d1">method</data>
  <data key="d2">Intelligence preparation is the process of gathering, processing, and analyzing intelligence to support task analysis and validate assumptions throughout plan formulation.&lt;SEP&gt;Intelligence Preparation is the process of collecting and analyzing intelligence information to support situation assessment.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-b76b9404888b1ba7ea6890ea44e06497&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-30f82772b0d833e6eb3891686c80b3f7</data>
