<node id="Enemy Situation">
  <data key="d0">Enemy Situation</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Enemy Situation refers to the status and intentions of the adversary, assessed during situation judgment.&lt;SEP&gt;Enemy Situation refers to intelligence about enemy forces, capabilities, and intentions, analyzed during operational planning.&lt;SEP&gt;Enemy Situation refers to information about enemy capabilities, intentions, and strategic posture.&lt;SEP&gt;Enemy situation refers to information about enemy forces, deployment, capabilities, and intentions.&lt;SEP&gt;Enemy situation refers to information about enemy forces, capabilities, intentions, and activities in a conflict area.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-b76b9404888b1ba7ea6890ea44e06497&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b3a38c5d2bd5aded4f705e8a27f80c90&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d03367b3f7f20f2a9f77e53026ed67d7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7ac85adc8a2b85efe002961c570418c8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eed702044df254afe00f3e24e778f48f</data>
