  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Quoted regarding the global nature of war planning.&lt;SEP&gt;Mao Zedong summarized war planning issues into the Eight Perspectives and emphasized dialectical analysis of war.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f89c6c0a89ad1a479cb3db03560939b9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-761ebe6109f1660d08131cf4842e3809</data>
