<node id="美军">
  <data key="d0">美军</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Originated operational mission planning concepts and developed various planning systems.&lt;SEP&gt;The military force that categorizes planning into Deliberate Planning, Crisis Action Planning, and Mission Planning Cycle.&lt;SEP&gt;The US Military values critical and innovative thinking in campaign design to overcome rigid mindsets.&lt;SEP&gt;The United States Military, which changed commanders three times during the Korean War due to Peng Dehuai's strategies.&lt;SEP&gt;The US military emphasizes the importance of sharing battlefield situation information and awareness in informationized joint operations.&lt;SEP&gt;美军是美国武装力量，在基于效果作战概念失败后放弃该概念，并转而研究其他作战设计方法。&lt;SEP&gt;美军是指美国的武装力量，这里指鲍德温所在的军事机构。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f89c6c0a89ad1a479cb3db03560939b9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2ad41c5f955e8f92f03f6d44d4fb9028&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-761ebe6109f1660d08131cf4842e3809&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-016b122f52ce767ff6277d5f69a238ab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-183c1795d5a56239a85ed103ac235df6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7b0ab60a625810ad5c7b928b03f9f35b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bc498b8576e8ab1b2cbded8e3f1ca004</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1778766715</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
</node>
