<node id="战场态势">
  <data key="d0">战场态势</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">The analysis and prediction of future battlefield states, serving as the condition for Pre-plan formulation and initial condition for Operation Mission Planning.&lt;SEP&gt;Battlefield situation refers to the confrontation state and形势formed by the deployment and use of combat forces by opposing sides in a battlefield environment.&lt;SEP&gt;Battlefield situation refers to the current state and developments in the combat environment, which influences target assessment and strike decisions.&lt;SEP&gt;Battlefield Situation refers to the overall status and conditions of the battlefield during combat operations.&lt;SEP&gt;战场态势是作战保障的内容之一，提供战场情况分析。&lt;SEP&gt;战场态势是战场上的军事力量部署和作战形势。</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6298c3a6f2e745ded5b18f2de5ac1a98&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1ed84de6534558d8934cfe16642690e3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eb01b90d552473d5580a711a2219da7e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9462b55eac26353ece0a6caed0d12c93&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-183c1795d5a56239a85ed103ac235df6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7b0ab60a625810ad5c7b928b03f9f35b</data>
