  <data key="d0">National Military Strategy</data>
  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">National Military Strategy serves as a guiding basis for US Military Joint Operations Concepts.&lt;SEP&gt;A strategic document used as a basis for functional domain analysis within the Mission Capability Description process.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f5c0970b8c1b0e778f4a08b68650be23&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-112dc88d3b89a6b06ab8767eb54ad739</data>
