  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Considered a key step in operational mission planning, involving conception of determination or plan.&lt;SEP&gt;Operational Design is the conceptualization and explanation of the framework for campaign plans, answering what and why.&lt;SEP&gt;Operational Design is a systematic approach to planning military operations based on identifying the center of gravity, analyzing key capabilities, critical requirements, and vulnerabilities, and connecting operational action decision points into operational lines.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-761ebe6109f1660d08131cf4842e3809&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-112dc88d3b89a6b06ab8767eb54ad739&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b3a38c5d2bd5aded4f705e8a27f80c90</data>
