<node id="Joint Intelligence Support">
  <data key="d0">Joint Intelligence Support</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Joint intelligence support provides timely intelligence data, analyzes battlefield situation changes, establishes cognitive pictures of enemy actions and capabilities, and supports command and control.&lt;SEP&gt;Joint intelligence support refers to the comprehensive intelligence coordination and support provided during military operations, involving collaboration among multiple government departments, intelligence units, and agencies.&lt;SEP&gt;Joint intelligence support is a dynamic intelligence processing and循环process that includes intelligence requirements summary, intelligence reconnaissance mission planning, intelligence collection and organization, intelligence analysis and processing, intelligence distribution and presentation, and intelligence feedback and evaluation.&lt;SEP&gt;Joint intelligence support provides prerequisite conditions, important guarantees, and reliable support for organizing combat operations, serving as an information input for combat planning.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-60ea72184694bbe0bd0d0c0b30a73271&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4e076ff2b14def31d05c594776649eee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c868520f6a3dc6f1e022369db6d23482&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dec14ab6a6d09aebc156102953b5c47d</data>
