<node id="Communication Support">
  <data key="d0">Communication Support</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Communication support ensures communication capabilities for plan formulation activities.&lt;SEP&gt;Communication Support involves constraint conditions, requirements, coordination of communication countermeasure activities, and planning, demonstration, evaluation, and approval of communication support plans.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-39f86d913e30094ae7d1d1fc8613aefc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-30f82772b0d833e6eb3891686c80b3f7</data>
