<node id="Combat Effectiveness Evaluation">
  <data key="d0">Combat Effectiveness Evaluation</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Combat effectiveness evaluation is a process that summarizes the combat status of task forces, prepares combat briefings for commanders and higher command, judges target strikes and damage, evaluates overall combat effectiveness, and determines whether expected operational goals are achieved.</data>
