  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Force resource evaluation involves assessing existing combat forces and resources based on campaign progress and trend judgments, identifying next-phase support conditions and capability requirements, evaluating overall combat capabilities and campaign impact, and proposing re-engagement preparation requirements.</data>
