  <data key="d0">Ground-Based Strike Operations</data>
  <data key="d1">concept</data>
  <data key="d2">Ground-based strike operations are components of combat task planning that typically include intelligence, firepower, coordination, trajectory, guidance, penetration, damage, early warning, defense, geographical, meteorological, and mapping support elements, covering the entire process of reconnaissance, control, resistance, strike, and evaluation.</data>
