<node id="Mao Zedong">
  <data key="d0">Mao Zedong</data>
  <data key="d1">person</data>
  <data key="d2">Mao Zedong is quoted as stating that the central issue of the overall situation is the center of gravity, which is the main contradiction affecting operations, with only one center of gravity in each phase.</data>
