  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">US Military JP2-0 is a US military doctrine that outlines ten principles for joint intelligence support work, including perspective, synchronization, sincerity, unity, prioritization, excellence, forecasting, flexibility, collaboration, and integration.</data>
